# Manual Method (Without ssh-copy-id)

Display public key:

```bash
cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub
```

Copy output.

Create directory:

```bash
mkdir -p ~/.ssh
chmod 700 ~/.ssh
```

Append key:

```bash
echo "<public-key>" >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
```

Permissions:

```bash
chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
```

