# Troubleshooting

## Permission Denied

Error:

```text
Permission denied (publickey)
```

Check:

```bash
chmod 700 ~/.ssh
chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
```

---

## Verify Authorized Key

```bash
cat ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
```

Ensure public key exists.

---

## Check SSH Directory

```bash
ls -ld ~/.ssh
```

Expected:

```text
drwx------  ~/.ssh
```

